	rss.NewRSSService(s.Profile, s.Store, apiV1Service.MarkdownService).RegisterRoutes(rootGroup)
```

**Runtime usage:** Handlers call methods on `s.MarkdownService` (e.g. `ExtractAll` in `memo_mention_helpers.go`, `GenerateSnippet` in `memo_service_webhooks.go`, `RenderHTML` in `rss/rss.go`). Memo create/update calls `memopayload.RebuildMemoPayload(..., s.MarkdownService)` (`memo_service.go`), which invokes `ExtractAll` on the passed interface.

**Not a separate Service impl:** `renderer.MarkdownRenderer` (`internal/markdown/renderer/markdown_renderer.go`) is instantiated inside `service.RenderMarkdown` and `service.RenameTag`; it is not behind `markdown.Service`. `memopayload.Runner` declares a `MarkdownService` field but is never constructed in production code — only `RebuildMemoPayload` is used, with the interface passed from `APIV1Service`.
